{"skill":{"slug":"onedrive-files","displayName":"OneDrive Files"},"version":{"version":"1.0.5","createdAt":1780989265631,"changelog":"Add UTM attribution tags (utm_source=clawhub) to ClawLink branding links so visits from this skill page are tracked as a distinct traffic source.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":17134,"sha256":"a036a544a2ba09eb9aec107bfa0fd1874cb1721adb36fb0ef224cecc19e5bf6f","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2571,"sha256":"9238921cee3bcc423f8c9dd0f775e3a388eaa4ee5a6618996487f0291cfcefef","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789543061350,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"134c7d23c119f76d0a8bf655ec8fc59ce3cc77c6498e5e6d05f74ff71cf3fd0f","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/134c7d23c119f76d0a8bf655ec8fc59ce3cc77c6498e5e6d05f74ff71cf3fd0f","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780989452140},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":21,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1789543061350},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"medium","summary":"This OneDrive skill is a disclosed ClawLink integration with broad cloud-file access, but its sensitive actions are purpose-aligned and require user confirmation for writes.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Access to OneDrive, SharePoint, sharing permissions, downloads, uploads, and permanent deletion is high-impact but proportionate to a file-management skill and described in the tool catalog.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill installs and allowlists the ClawLink plugin and restarts the OpenClaw gateway; this is disclosed and coherent with the integration, but the artifact does not pin an immutable plugin version.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The instructions tell the agent to use live tool discovery, prefer read operations first, preview writes, and confirm write, delete, and sharing actions with the user before execution.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The plugin allowlist and gateway restart persist beyond the current chat, but this setup behavior is explicit and no hidden background worker, memory write, or unauthorized persistence is shown.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is to browse, search, download, upload, share, and manage OneDrive and SharePoint files through Microsoft Graph, and the documented tools match that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable connecting your Microsoft account through ClawLink. Review the Microsoft consent screen, use the least-privileged account suitable for the task, and require explicit confirmation before uploads, deletions, permission changes, or sharing-link creation.","findings":"[E4] expected: The referenced 'upload session' text describes Microsoft Graph-style file upload behavior, not leakage of chat/session context; I found no artifact instruction to send agent conversation data externally.\n[T08] expected: The skill does instruct installation of an external ClawLink plugin with OAuth-mediated OneDrive access; this is central to the stated purpose and disclosed, though users should note the unpinned install and third-party token handling.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789543061350}}}}}